</blockquote>
<p>I do want to comment on this, because this actually was something I wanted to touch on in my work, and is a big part of how I think about the department of Pataphysics. Here are some examples:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>So, the O5s did the Foundation-ly thing: they thought &quot;What are the practical implications of our fictionality?&quot; &quot;How can this be used to our ends?&quot; And so, the Department of Pataphysics was born.</p>
